flowchart TD
    %% ---------- Input ----------
    Player([👤 Player]) -->|guess + settings| UI["Streamlit UI<br/>app.py"]
    UI -->|parse & validate| Logic["Game Logic<br/>logic_utils.py<br/>parse_guess · check_guess · update_score"]
    Logic -->|Too High / Too Low / Win| UI

    %% ---------- AI hint pipeline ----------
    UI -->|"wrong guess + 🤖 toggle ON"| Level["Hint Level Planner<br/>get_hint_level()<br/>vague → moderate → specific → very specific"]
    Level --> Prompt["Prompt Builder<br/>secret · range · attempts · past guesses · past hints"]
    Prompt --> Gemini[["☁️ Google Gemini<br/>gemini-3.5-flash-lite"]]
    Gemini -->|response text| Filter{"Answer Filter<br/>contains_secret()<br/>digits or words?"}
    Filter -->|"leak detected → retry with feedback (max 3)"| Prompt
    Gemini -.->|"error / 429 / timeout → backoff & retry"| Prompt
    Filter -->|clean hint| UI
    Filter -->|"still failing / no API key"| Fallback["Built-in Fallback Hint<br/>fallback_hint()"]
    Fallback --> UI

    %% ---------- End of game ----------
    UI -->|"game over + 🤖 toggle ON"| Fact["Fun Fact Generator<br/>generate_fun_fact()"]
    Fact --> Gemini
    Fact --> UI
    UI -->|hints, result, fun fact| Player

    %% ---------- Logging ----------
    Logger[("📜 logs/game.log<br/>logging_config.py")]
    UI -.->|guesses, games| Logger
    Filter -.->|filtered leaks| Logger
    Gemini -.->|calls, errors, latency| Logger

    %% ---------- Testing & human review ----------
    subgraph Testing["🧪 Testing & Human Review"]
        Pytest["pytest<br/>tests/test_game_logic.py<br/>tests/test_ai_hints.py (fake AI)"]
        Eval["Reliability Evaluator<br/>evaluate_hints.py<br/>leak · fallback · error · latency rates"]
        Human["👩‍💻 Developer<br/>reviews eval report, logs<br/>& hint quality"]
    end
    Pytest -.->|verifies| Logic
    Pytest -.->|verifies| Filter
    Eval -.->|runs many games against| Level
    Eval --> Human
    Logger --> Human